Webinar Email Campaign with Open Tracking — n8n Workflow
Builder: Rodrigo Espinosa Quinteros
Type: n8n Automation Workflow
Status: Active — executed for live webinar campaign (October 2025)
Trigger: Scheduled one-time (October 6, 8:00 AM) + Manual trigger
Domain: Email Marketing, Lead Nurturing, Campaign Analytics

Overview
A targeted email campaign workflow that sends a personalized webinar invitation to
every contact in a master database who has not yet registered — then tracks exactly
who opens each email, logging the recipient address and open timestamp back to Google
Sheets via an embedded tracking pixel.
No external email marketing platform required. The entire pipeline — deduplication,
batched sending, rate limiting, and open tracking analytics — runs inside n8n using
Google Sheets, Microsoft Outlook, and a self-hosted webhook.

